#lem: Arali[1]GN; ki[place]; saŋki[forehead]; kalam[the Land (of Sumer)]
#tr.en: their boat @noteref{i.e. @wRN{Ur-@wDN{Namma}}} was sunk in a land as foreign to them as @wGN{Dilmun}. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.62

