#lem: X; X; X; X; X; X; X; ŋar[put]; sahar[soil]; ses[bitter]; gub[stand]
#tr.en: the Land was deprived of its ornament. The journey to the nether world is a desolate route. 
#etcsl: line-id=1.69

1.70. lugal X [anše]-ni ba-da-dur₂-ru anše ki mu-un-di-ni-ib-tum₂
#lem: lugal[king]; X; anše[equid]; dur[sit]; anše[equid]; ki[place]; tum[bring]
